      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Klickitat%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The naturally carbonated Klickitat Mineral Springs just east of town sparked health spas, a beverage company, and a dry‑ice plant that operated until 1957.",
